{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id158298891"}, "name":{"label":"Badgal_d_z"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-22T16:59:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14822725780"}, "title":{"label":"Lost My Trust — Won’t Be Renewing"}, "content":{"label":"I’m deeply disappointed that Flighty forces paying customers to use Apple Maps and its politically motivated renaming of the Gulf of Mexico as the “Gulf of America,” with absolutely no option to choose another map provider or restore the internationally recognized name.\n\nThis is not a minor cosmetic issue. It’s about trust, integrity, and consumer choice. I pay for Flighty to track flights, not to have a political administration’s preferred terminology imposed on me through an app I otherwise enjoyed using.\n\nI understand that Apple controls its map data. Flighty, however, is responsible for the experience it sells its customers. Offering no alternative is a product decision, and one that has seriously damaged my trust in this company.\n\nI no longer feel comfortable supporting Flighty with my money. When my current subscription expires, I will not renew it.\n\nI expect more from a premium app than unquestioning dependence on another company’s geographic labeling decisions. Flighty has lost a paying customer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
