{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id36864789"}, "name":{"label":"Julton"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-16T15:52:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14799495079"}, "title":{"label":"Essential flight tracker"}, "content":{"label":"Super simple and straightforward flight tracker. Great free version functionality and solid functions to upgrade if you need some extra notifications or info. Easy to use and understand. Excellent app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id159369449"}, "name":{"label":"HonestReviews5271"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-16T14:32:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14799288964"}, "title":{"label":"Great app design but the delay estimates are almost always off"}, "content":{"label":"One of the major reasons for me using this app over the airline apps is the feature of seeing where the aircraft is I’m about to board. Often times you can see early that it’s never going to depart in time since it’s not even close. Unfortunately, flightys own estimates on if we are going to make it on time are almost always way to optimistic. You can literally see with basic math that the time isn’t enough and flighty app still says “enough time for departure on time despite the delay”. Not sure how this can be so bad …", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id545419976"}, "name":{"label":"jeevacation"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-16T10:48:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14798664792"}, "title":{"label":"Useful and beautiful"}, "content":{"label":"I am an iOS developer myself, and most apps I use leave me thinking of all the ways I could have done it better if I had the time. Not so for Flighty; instead I feel rather jealous that I’ll never make an app with this much beauty and polish and function.\n\nSome personal highlights for me are\n• there’s no account creation, it just uses iCloud sync, including sharing functionality\n• there is a lifetime purchase option\n\nThere are very few iOS apps I flat-out recommend to others, and this is absolutely one of them.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1944618007"}, "name":{"label":"Lirizarry1nyc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-16T08:20:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14798194764"}, "title":{"label":"This is a great app"}, "content":{"label":"This app connects to your calendar and automatically tracks those flights for you, if you pay for the service it alerts you and provides more detailed information, but even if using it free- it saves me so much time trying to figure out when my elderly mom flies anywhere.  It only works in iPhone or Mac i believe.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id131990494"}, "name":{"label":"RalphEschen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-15T18:30:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14796028960"}, "title":{"label":"Gulf of “America”"}, "content":{"label":"I am disappointed that your flight-tracking app uses the politically imposed name “Gulf of America” instead of the historically established geographic name “Gulf of Mexico.”\n\nA flight-tracking application should be about accurate aviation information, not adopting politically motivated changes to geographic terminology.\n\nI recognize that your map provider may be responsible for the labeling, but I would like to see your company take a position and provide users with the option of using internationally recognized geographic names.\n\nUntil then, I am reluctant to support an application that perpetuates this change.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1117992049"}, "name":{"label":"Janks03"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-15T16:38:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14795736705"}, "title":{"label":"Frequent fliers"}, "content":{"label":"We love this app-we would really love to do the lifetime membership, but there is no annual family plan and the cost is quite high for individuals! Only reason for less stars because it seems like it’s really awesome and capable of so much but as a family of 6 it’s very unaffordable", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id40685640"}, "name":{"label":"Feelingmoody"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-15T14:50:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"14795455600"}, "title":{"label":"Love it … except the limited act options"}, "content":{"label":"A great product and I would gladly pay for it except for the fact you’re tied to one single Apple ID - an absolute showstopper for those of us who travel for work with a corporate device but don’t want to commit to a work account forever. This is communicated as a benefit to users, but it comes across as a frustrating glitch. Having an android version would help but that’s not available either, despite a subscription that approaches the cost of professional aviation apps I use as a pilot.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1358823008&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
